name: ps_dispute_window
dataset: settlement_dispute
measure: sum(window_alert)
by[1]: dispute_key
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
severity: CRITICAL
description: "The contractual dispute window of a partner cycle with dispute lines closes within window_alert_days (Job ps_dispute, default 5) of the as-of day. One Incident per partner and cycle, grouped into that cycle's dispute Case. It reads the data, not the Case: a Case already DISPUTED is reminded too. Runbook: config/runbooks/partner-settlement-runbooks.md."
